<title>BRAZIL: Brazil coffee council to be installed December 18.</title>
<headline>Brazil coffee council to be installed December 18.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A first meeting of Brazil's new Coffee Committee will take place on December 18, an Industry and Commerce Ministry spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The meeting, which will begin at 1500 local/1700 GMT, will be the first of the new committee, set up October to define coffee policy.</p>
<p>The committee will include representatives of the Brazilian government and of the country's exporters, roasters, soluble industry and producers.</p>
<p>-- William Schomberg, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358</p>
